<https://w3id.org/ratr-o#ModelingAgencyScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A supposed modelling, acting, influencer or image agency recruits young women, occasionally men, with the promise of bookings abroad. The first 'casting' is used to produce compromising photographs and to extract personal data. Subsequent 'shoots' lead to sexual exploitation, pornographic production without consent or forced escort work. Documented end-state of recruitment on Facebook Marketplace and Instagram DMs in Mexico and Colombia."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ratr-o#PurposeForcedLabour> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Forced labour or services"@en .
