<https://w3id.org/ratr-o#FatalismSignal> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Normalises early death or no exit ('quizas manana ya no este', 'de aqui ya no sales'). Colmex 2025, images 16 and 18."@en .
