<https://w3id.org/ratr-o#ConstructionLabourBondageScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Offer of construction work abroad or in another state with housing and 'flight to site' included. Upon arrival the worker finds pay deductions for housing, transport and tools that exceed the wage; documents are retained; movement off site is restricted. Documented by ILO in the Gulf States labour corridor (most notoriously Qatar World Cup preparation) and by HRW and Polaris in the US-Mexico corridor for Mexican and Central-American workers. Also attested internally in Mexico for workers displaced from southern states to the northern border."@en .
