<https://w3id.org/ratr-o#CredibleLethalPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A survivor-testimony pattern where the offer itself looks plausible and the risk sits in the logistics of the first contact (nameless WhatsApp, multi-use building, 'come alone', 'no ID', Messenger-to-WhatsApp funnel, personal-data filter). Type B in Ramona's dual-track classification."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ratr-o#SocialMediaComment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Social-media comment"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ratr-o#postedOn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "posted on"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ratr-o#OnlineRecruitmentChannel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A digital communication channel used by recruiters to contact candidates. Controlled vocabulary covers Messenger, WhatsApp, Telegram, Marketplace, TikTok, SMS, classifieds and other."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ratr-o#hasTitle> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/ratr-o#JobOffer> .
<https://w3id.org/ratr-o#schemePreferredTool> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/ratr-o#itemMatchesTerm> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/ratr-o#ForcedChildMarriageScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://www.oaxaca.gob.mx/sm/matrimonio-infantil-forzado-una-forma-de-trata-smo/> .
<https://w3id.org/ratr-o#exhibitsAction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relates a job offer to the Palermo Action it realises. For a deceptive recruitment offer this is normally :Recruitment."@en .
