<https://w3id.org/ratr-o#classifiedOn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Date on which the classification was produced."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ratr-o#tipEventHappenedIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "TIP event happened in country"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ratr-o#Receipt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The ACT of receipt of persons in the sense of Palermo Protocol Article 3(a): taking the person into one's control at the end of a transfer."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ratr-o#BelicoStoryPost> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Third recruitment story of Colmex 2025 (pp. 47-50). Persuades without an explicit offer (no NR). Sufficient condition ECC AND A AND AVC is computed in the mapping."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ratr-o#GroupEmojiSignal> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
