<https://w3id.org/ratr-o#CentralAmericanMigrantLabourScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/ratr-o#DebtBondageTraffickingScheme> .
<https://w3id.org/ratr-o#platformCountry> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/ratr-o#Platform> .
