<https://w3id.org/ratr-o#RecruitmentHashtagSignal> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Hashtag #reclutamiento, used by Colmex 2025 as an entry point to the corpus (p. 27)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ratr-o#recruiterCountry> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "recruiter country"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ratr-o#CentralAmericanMigrantLabourScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Central-American migrant labour exploitation scheme"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ratr-o#routeIsTransnational> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Whether the route crosses an international border. Internal routes matter in Mexico, where most documented recruitment-to-exploitation movement is domestic."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ratr-o#victimCaseClosedAt> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
