<https://w3id.org/ratr-o#OnlineInfluencerSalesScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The candidate is offered a paid role as 'brand ambassador', 'community manager trainee' or 'social media sales associate'. The role requires the candidate to set up their own social accounts, purchase the product catalogue, and 'earn' from commission and from recruiting further ambassadors. In effect a pyramid or MLM structure presented as a creator-economy job. Commonly used by cosmetic, fashion and digital-education brands."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ratr-o#historicalOfferCount> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Number of offers previously recorded for this agent in Ramona's own data."@en .
