<https://w3id.org/ratr-o#containsRedFlag> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relates a job offer to a red flag detected in its text. Kept alongside :hasRedFlag because the mapping layer populates them from different sources: :containsRedFlag from text classification, :hasRedFlag from the reviewed classification record."@en .
