<https://w3id.org/ratr-o#recruitsFor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "recruits for scheme"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ratr-o#ExploitationPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A pattern describing the final exploitation outcome attested or suggested in the evidence source (labour hospitality, sexual, forced criminality, organ removal)."@en .
