<https://w3id.org/ratr-o#CommunicationTool> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "Eight tools in the reference vocabulary. Of the 295 offers in the verified press corpus, 106 name the platform they were carried on: WhatsApp leads with 37 of those 106, which is 12.5% of the whole corpus. The figure of 21% in earlier versions of this note is not supported by the shipped data and is withdrawn. Counted on 10 November 2026."@en .
