<https://w3id.org/ratr-o#SelfApplicationComment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A comment in which a user asks to join or offers themself to a criminal group (e.g. 'busco jale', 'que se ocupa para entrar', 'puedo entrar con 16'). Colmex 2025, images 2, 4, 13-15, 20 and 22."@en .
