<https://w3id.org/ratr-o#DebtBondageTraffickingScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The offer relocates the candidate to a destination where exploitation is performed, often across borders, and binds the victim through a manufactured debt: smuggling fees, transportation, housing, paperwork. Covers the Tapachula-to-United States labour-exploitation corridor, the Latin-America-to-Western-Europe sex-trafficking pattern (e.g. falsely advertised childcare jobs in Paris), and domestic-work trafficking with document retention."@en .
