<https://w3id.org/ratr-o#DomesticWorkerLockInScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The candidate is hired as a live-in domestic worker, caregiver or nanny and then isolated inside the employer's household: documents withheld, phone confiscated or rationed, days-off refused, movement outside the home forbidden. Wages are withheld or paid to a family member. Common end-state of VisaFraudScheme placements abroad and of internal placements from rural to urban Mexico."@en .
