<https://w3id.org/ratr-o#RecruiterReplyComment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A short reply by the post author or an associated account redirecting to a private channel or welcoming the applicant (e.g. 'manda mensaje', 'DM', 'bienvenido cuando quieras'). Colmex 2025, images 4, 13-14 and 18."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ratr-o#TraffickingRoute> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "1,778 routes in the seeds: 1,771 CTDC corridors, each with at least 3 victims, plus 7 routes attested in the press and curated by hand. Both sets are keyed by ISO 3166-1 alpha-3. Counted against the seed files on 10 November 2026."@en .
