<https://w3id.org/ratr-o#evidenceStrength> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "primary / secondary / tertiary. Primary = direct survivor testimony, official statistics, court record; secondary = investigative journalism; tertiary = summary or editorial article."@en .
