<https://w3id.org/ratr-o#CredibleLethalRedFlag> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A logistic signal inside an otherwise plausible offer: nameless company, WhatsApp without logo, meeting in a multi-use building, asked to come alone or without ID, Messenger-to-WhatsApp funnel, atypical hours, personal-data harvesting, plausible bait role, last-minute relocation. The value is in :flagType."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ratr-o#routeName> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Human-readable name of the route."@en .
