<https://w3id.org/ratr-o#SportsTalentScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Offer to join a 'football academy' in Europe, a 'baseball academy' in the US, or a 'boxing camp' abroad, with flight and training fees. Victim (usually an adolescent) is abandoned at destination when the agency disappears or is placed under exploitative training contracts with no professional outcome. Extensively documented by FIFPro (World Players Union) in its 2018 Africa report and by ILO in the Latin-America to Europe and Asia to Gulf corridors for youth football. Also attested in baseball recruiting in the Dominican Republic and Venezuela."@en .
