<https://w3id.org/ratr-o#ForcedChildMarriageScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The offer frames a minor's placement as marriage or an 'informal union' under customary practice (usos y costumbres). The Secretaría de las Mujeres de Oaxaca recognises this explicitly as a form of human trafficking. According to ENADID 2014, 44.82% of women in Chiapas, 42.41% in Guerrero and 39.17% in Oaxaca reported child marriage or early union. Recognised by UNICEF as a harmful practice and by UN Women as a form of gender-based violence. Maps to :PurposeServitude in the Palermo Protocol."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ratr-o#offers> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "offers"@en .
