<https://w3id.org/ratr-o#victimReferralSource> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "How the victim was identified: self-report, NGO, law enforcement, embassy, hotline."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ratr-o#offeredRole> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Job title or role as named in the offer, in the words of the offer."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ratr-o#hasRawText> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "offer raw text"@en .
