<https://w3id.org/ratr-o#SocialMediaRecruitmentSignal> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A textual or symbolic cue in a social-media item associated with criminal recruitment. Derived from the lexicon in data/lexicon/tiktok_reclutamiento_lexicon.csv (Colmex 2025)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ratr-o#itemHashtags> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
